data: {"id": "9cd1a21457cf4773-thinking-parallel_evidence-615", "run_id": "9cd1a21457cf4773", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "kubectl_describe", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "kubectl_describe 输出 workload-code (aiops-case-07) 详细配置与源码。该资源包含 driver.py 和 server.py 两个 Python 脚本，实现 HTTP 服务，监听 8080 端口，具备 /work, /metrics, /ready, /health 端点，支持通过环境变量 FAILURE_MODE 模拟不同故障模式 (runtime_", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789076277363, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "kubernetes"}, "tool_call_id": "call_00e8c300847a43b88aea1f34", "tool_sequence": 12, "semantic_success": true, "result": "kubectl_describe 输出 workload-code (aiops-case-07) 详细配置与源码。该资源包含 driver.py 和 server.py 两个 Python 脚本，实现 HTTP 服务，监听 8080 端口，具备 /work, /metrics, /ready, /health 端点，支持通过环境变量 FAILURE_MODE 模拟不同故障模式 (runtime_exit, oom_growth 等)，并集成 OpenTelemetry 链路追踪导出。当前无 Events。\nkey_facts: [\"资源名: workload-code, Namespace: aiops-case-07\", \"数据文件: driver.py (客户端流量生成), server.py (HTTP 服务逻辑)\", \"server.py 监听端口: 8080\", \"关键环境变量: TARGET_URL, CASE_RUN_ID, FAILURE_MODE, OTEL_SERVICE_NAME, POD_NAME, POD_NAMESPACE\", \"故障模式支持: normal, runtime_exit, config_missing_exit, oom_growth, readiness_fail, liveness_fail\", \"依赖服务: OTLP_HTTP_ENDPOINT (默认 http://lgtm.monitor.svc:4318/v1/traces)\", \"Events: <none>\"]", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/9cd1a21457cf4773-g1/tools/013-evidence-kubectl_describe.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/9cd1a21457cf4773-g1/tools/013-evidence-kubectl_describe.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/9cd1a21457cf4773-g1/tools/013-evidence-kubectl_describe.summary.txt"}

