 `config_missing_exit` 模式，排除了基础设施故障。\n*   **排除干扰**：资源配置（#8）显示有充裕的内存和 CPU 配额，且退出码非 137 (OOM)，佐证了这是应用逻辑层面的失败而非资源耗尽。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用运行于 config_missing_exit 模式 (Tracing/Evidence #7) → 启动后处理 /work 请求时检测关键配置缺失 (Logging/Evidence #5) → 主动抛出 HTTP 500 并以退出码 78 终止进程 (K8s State/Evidence #2, Logging/Evidence #5) → K8s 自动重启机制触发，反复进入 CrashLoopBackOff (K8s Event/Evidence #3, Metrics/Evidence #4)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：** Pod `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl` 中的 `app` 容器运行于模拟故障模式 `config_missing_exit`。在该模式下，应用启动后在响应 HTTP `GET /work` 请求时检测到关键配置缺失（日志标识 `CONFIG_MISSING`），随后主动抛出 `HTTP 500` 错误并以退出码 `78` 终止自身进程。\n\n**依据：**\n*   日志系统记录了明确的错误模式 `CONFIG_MISSING` 及伴随的 `500` 状态码（证据 #5）。\n*   追踪系统确认应用属性 `aiops.observed_mode` 为 `config_missing_exit`，且返回 `500`（证据 #7）。\n*   K8s 层面显示容器因非零退出码（78）被终止，并导致 Pod 进入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（证据 #1, #2, #3）。\n\n**排除项：** 资源配额充足（证据 #8），排除因内存或 CPU 超限导致的 OOMKilled。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 94.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl: 94.1s (Evidence 88.0s, RCA 5.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 16.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 126.237, "metrics": {"run_id": "9cd1a21457cf4773", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 126.24397873878479, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 126243.97873878479, "llm_calls": 17, "llm_duration_ms": 83550.82869529724, "tool_calls": 24, "executed_tool_calls": 19, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 23, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 71809.61298942566, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 42222.12028503418}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15233.241081237793, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 94097.3219871521, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 16892.027854919434, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

